{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-05", "pageid": 134677, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-04\" title=\"春日迟-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-06\" title=\"春日迟-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.91.87.E8.90.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"摇落\">摇落</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 摇落</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Withered Grass</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你的剪纸燕子真好用！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这便是东门渡吗？确实与我记忆中的不太一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯，与镇上也大不相同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>岸边树木并无绿意，仍旧挂着寒霜。眺望前方，隐约能看见算不上湍急的江水穿过枯草环绕的江滩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处高大而破旧的屋舍门口，须发皆白的老者望着枯树发呆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你果然也这么觉得！你说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然间，骡子仰起脖子长嘶一声，撒开四蹄向前方跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>咴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-647114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-647114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-647114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你别急啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>唉，唉，不是叫你跟着人家吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骡子在老者身边停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>老丈，既然它不愿意走，你就留下它吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我只是想帮上些忙，原不是为了报酬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>不成不成，老头这把年纪，也用不上它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>唉，你可是个有力气的好伙伴，跟着我可惜了，是不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>咴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>我知道，我都知道。你不想走，但咱们没办法啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>前几年还有行脚的客人来，算是能过。如今……唉，我也养不了你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者亲昵地伸手拨弄骡子的耳朵，又叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>你看我，光顾着说它的事。姑娘这么快就回来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>老丈，你放心，我请来了真正的高人——这位是鹭鸶剪前辈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>之前是我学艺不精，她一定能为你排忧解难！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道人对老者笑笑，抬头望向不远处枯萎的杏花树，若有所思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔……看来没找错地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>不必折腾了，姑娘。好日子过去了，哪还有回来的道理？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>唉，道长，也难为你被她拉着胡闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>这怎么是胡闹呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>外头风大，还请先到小老儿家中说话吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>家中简陋，没什么好招待的，我去煮些茶来，给你们吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>依旧明亮的天光从窗外透进来，窗上雕花已经磨损得看不出原先的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋内的家具陈设精致非常，只是都旧了，显得有些寂寥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>眼下老丈出去了，我们不必担心惊吓到他，就敞开了说吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>敞开了说？你指什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>老丈不明白其中关窍，可你我都是修行之人，该知道此处深受气脉凝滞之苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>这一路走来，你有没有发现什么异常？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>如此说来，我今日遇到的异常倒有许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……许多吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>睡觉时遇到人打架，被骡子偷吃了绿豆糕；行了十里，倒有八里在迷路……桩桩都是异常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我是说，与气脉相关的异常！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>非要说的话……我依稀记得，此地从前应有个繁华的渡口……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>——如今还知晓这处旧渡口的人可不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者端来粗瓷碗，其中浓浓地沏了酽茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将茶碗放在桌上。桌面的漆色已磨得斑驳，却擦得干干净净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>道长尝尝本地的土茶。从前这渡口还在的时候，吴地的人喝了都喜欢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>虽说，如今也比不得外头时兴的茶叶了……但好歹能解解渴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没事没事，我不讲究这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抿了一口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这茶很好嘛！不比我在别处喝的差。阿措，你也尝尝？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我？我……我上回来的时候尝过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的修行者双手捧住微烫的茶碗，有些心不在焉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>犹豫片刻，她身体微微前倾，专注地看着对面的道人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你既然已探查过四周，请实话告诉我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>淳镇如此萧条，究其缘由，是不是此地气脉出了大问题？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗外，一片枯叶无声落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……没有吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯，气脉确实不畅。但要把一地兴衰都归咎于它……它倒也担不起这么大的罪过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我不是说过吗？聚散离合、兴衰更迭，这里的缘由可能有许多。或许是商路改了道，或许是人心向了别处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>月有阴晴圆缺，树有生发枯荣嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>世间诸事，并不全因术法而起，也并不总能用术法挽回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>姑娘，道长说得在理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>你说的那些……什么气脉，老头听不懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>可这些年有了新的商道，大家都愿意从祝县过，渡口连带着镇子，自然也就荒废了……这也是常情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>道长，您别介意。小姑娘年轻，也心善，总觉得什么都该有个道理、有个办法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>不是气脉的问题吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——不过，眼前倒真有一桩麻烦，是那滞涩的气脉带来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道人话锋一转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>枯木逢春……我做不到把春天带回来，但如果只是让一棵老树重新开花，倒不太难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>这……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>唉，当年淳镇的渡口还兴盛，乡里风俗，大家都在附近种树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>离家的人惦念着家门前的树，还没靠岸，就知道到家了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>我家世代住在渡口边，这棵杏花树就是先祖归家的念想，几代人都在树下长大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>我祖父在这树下送我爹去跑船；我父亲也在这树下，看着我第一次撑船离岸……每一次回来，船还没靠稳，最先出现的就是它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>现在渡口荒了……我有时候想，我和渡口，还有这树，我们毕竟都老了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>它若真能再开花，对我这老头子而言，便算了却一桩天大的心愿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪歪着头想了想，忽然笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她掐了个手诀，一朵红色的剪纸梅花从她手中慢慢飘落到斑驳的桌面上。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-05"}}